1
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,110
Eldrie?

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,940
I know that name.

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,840
Hey, get ready.

4
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,680
I'm gonna keep him busy.

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,960
When I give the signal, you're up. Got it.

6
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,740
Using your chains as a weapon, huh?

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,920
Then I'll forego my sword.

8
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,480
And use this instead.

9
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,080
System Call.

10
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,900
Enhance Armament.

11
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,160
Don't sweat it.

12
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,160
A whip can only reach so far.

13
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:34,960
We're safe here.

14
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:42,870
Impressive.

15
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:47,720
My divine frost scale whip is fast, but
it seems you're faster. You all right?

16
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,720
His whip did that?

17
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:54,757
Yu-Gi-Oh, I'll try to find
a way to stop his whip.

18
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,134
You sneak around back.

19
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:01,300
If you've finished plotting,
we should wrap this up.

20
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:04,620
Now, come at me and keep me entertained.

21
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:51,791
To you, the big yourself.

22
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:18,917
When will it be, I will be the first one?

23
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:21,235
The end of athe transition of the war.

24
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:45,217
System Call.

25
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:47,740
Generate thermal element.

26
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:51,560
Generate cryogenic element.

27
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,560
Form element.

28
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:56,860
Arrow shape.

29
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,560
Form element.

30
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,100
Bird shape.

31
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,760
Counter thermal object.

32
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:05,660
Discharge.

33
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,320
Discharge.

34
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:32,200
It seems I overestimated you.

35
00:03:32,540 --> 00:03:34,620
However, I am merciful.

36
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,652
You'll be unconscious before you know it.

37
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,320
My turn!

38
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:58,020
Perhaps it was presumptuous of
me to underestimate you earlier.

39
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:02,020
It seems you've managed to
do me some harm after all.

40
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:04,417
Yeah, well, that's what you get.

41
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:07,440
I must say, your style of combat.

42
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:11,600
There's something oddly
familiar about it. Really?

43
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:17,037
Then I guess you must have come up against
a swordsman of the surloop style before.

44
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,720
That, my dear criminal, is not possible.

45
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:25,160
As I previously said, I was summoned as
a knight to this realm one month ago.

46
00:04:25,580 --> 00:04:27,360
Yeah, right. I bet you were.

47
00:04:28,420 --> 00:04:29,420
How's that work?

48
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:32,798
Does someone snap their
fingers and you come running?

49
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:06,160
No wonder Lady Alice was wary of you.

50
00:05:06,540 --> 00:05:10,960
Your attacks have no pattern, which
is surprising and slightly irritating.

51
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:15,776
What irritates me more is you forced
me to use my memory release skill.

52
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:17,740
That's it.

53
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:21,060
Yeah, now I know where I
heard your name before.

54
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:26,517
You were the champion swordsman
this year from Norlinggarth Empire.

55
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:29,820
And then, you won the
Unification Tournament.

56
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,880
You're Eldrie Wolvesburg.

57
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:36,280
Champion from the Norlinggarth Empire?

58
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:39,660
Eldrie Wolvesburg?

59
00:05:39,860 --> 00:05:41,017
It's true, Sir Knight.

60
00:05:41,100 --> 00:05:46,240
This year, if I remember correctly, you
won every match with a single stroke.

61
00:05:46,460 --> 00:05:47,636
What are you saying?

62
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:49,996
That's preposterous.

63
00:05:50,180 --> 00:05:51,980
I am Eldrie Synthesis 31.

64
00:05:52,380 --> 00:05:56,600
I have never heard the name
Wolfsburg before. But... Enough!

65
00:05:56,980 --> 00:05:59,280
Hold your tongue, you blasphemer!

66
00:06:00,100 --> 00:06:02,747
I was summoned to this
world by the Pontifex.

67
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:05,520
I am here by Administrator's will.

68
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:10,045
I descended as an Integrity Knight
from the heavens, I tell you!

69
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:26,040
What's that?

70
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:33,860
I bet Alice got one of those too when
they blocked her memory and changed her.

71
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:35,910
Eldrie!

72
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,560
Eldrie Wolfsburg!

73
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,117
Uh, uh, uh, uh.

74
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,030
Eugeo!

75
00:06:41,113 --> 00:06:42,457
Know anything else about him?

76
00:06:42,540 --> 00:06:43,700
Anything at all.

77
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:46,233
Something to trigger more of his memory.

78
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:47,650
Eldrie!

79
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:52,320
Your father is Estor Wolfsburg,
the Imperial Knight's general.

80
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:56,240
Your mother's name is,
I think, Almera? Uh.

81
00:06:56,380 --> 00:06:57,740
Yeah, it's Almera.

82
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:00,130
Uh, Almera.

83
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:11,320
That's right! Remember her!

84
00:07:11,700 --> 00:07:12,660
Remember her!

85
00:07:14,540 --> 00:07:15,480
Kirito!

86
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:28,557
You okay?

87
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:31,840
Step away from Knight 31, criminals.

88
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:37,080
Tempting an Integrity Knight to
fall from grace is unforgivable.

89
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,700
You wretches.

90
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:42,800
I shall pin you down, then
return you to your cell.

91
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:44,980
This way!

92
00:07:52,060 --> 00:07:53,000
Which way?

93
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,180
Go right.

94
00:07:56,220 --> 00:07:57,460
Fugio, go right!

95
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,860
Dead end up ahead!

96
00:08:07,140 --> 00:08:08,100
What do we do?

97
00:08:08,980 --> 00:08:09,810
Hey!

98
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,580
Over here!

99
00:08:12,140 --> 00:08:13,120
Follow her.

100
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:35,980
Where are we?

101
00:08:38,700 --> 00:08:40,171
Now they know we're here.

102
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:42,518
We can't use this back door anymore.

103
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,830
Thank you.

104
00:08:55,060 --> 00:08:56,560
We were really in a bind.

105
00:08:57,220 --> 00:08:59,037
Who are you? I'm Yu-Gi-Oh.

106
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:00,177
It's nice to meet you.

107
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:01,090
Wait a sec.

108
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,860
And this is Kirito.

109
00:09:08,260 --> 00:09:10,300
We really appreciate your help.

110
00:09:10,540 --> 00:09:11,637
Is this some...

111
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,720
where you live?

112
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:15,040
No, of course it isn't.

113
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:17,480
Come with me.

114
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:24,480
So, uh, are we in the Central Cathedral?

115
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:28,000
Yes and no, but neither
of you have to worry.

116
00:09:28,740 --> 00:09:31,657
Although the space is
technically in the Cathedral,

117
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:34,034
I've deleted the regular doorway to it.

118
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,671
No one can enter here from that point now.

119
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:40,160
Well, unless I invite them.

120
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:54,860
It's a library.

121
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:56,290
Indeed.

122
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:59,659
The records of this world's
entire history are here,

123
00:09:59,820 --> 00:10:03,497
as well as the formulas of
everything created under the heavens.

124
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:08,860
That includes every system command, or
what you refer to as the sacred arts.

125
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,880
Wait, system commands?

126
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,397
Who are you?

127
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:14,320
My name is Cardinal.

128
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:17,420
I was once the regulator of this world,

129
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:21,360
but now I am the sole curator
of this great library.

130
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,460
All our history?

131
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:25,850
Precisely.

132
00:10:25,933 --> 00:10:27,717
There is also a record of the creation.

133
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:30,137
When Vecta and Stacia split the world!

134
00:10:30,220 --> 00:10:32,867
into the human empire
and the dark territory.

135
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:35,920
You may read them if you wish.

136
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:40,325
But first, would you hold
out your right hands?

137
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:43,910
Hmm.

138
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,190
There.

139
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:54,180
You feeling okay? Yeah.

140
00:10:57,880 --> 00:11:01,527
You're going to catch a cold if
you stay in those wet clothes.

141
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:06,112
At the end of the hall through there,
you'll find a small bath you may use.

142
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:07,920
Thanks a lot.

143
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:10,160
I'm grateful for your hospitality.

144
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:14,760
Can I, um, see the,
um, record of creation?

145
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:19,760
It is located up the stairs
in the history section.

146
00:11:20,460 --> 00:11:23,401
After you bathe, you may
read it with your supper.

147
00:11:23,820 --> 00:11:25,200
You're much too kind.

148
00:11:25,460 --> 00:11:27,048
I'll be back in a bit then.

149
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:34,460
What those records won't reveal

150
00:11:35,180 --> 00:11:39,280
is that the pontifex of the Axiom
Church fabricated all of it.

151
00:11:40,060 --> 00:11:41,531
Let me get this straight.

152
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:44,500
You're saying the gods here are fake? Yes.

153
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:49,781
The myths the people of the underworld
believe are just propaganda,

154
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:53,020
all invented by the church
to maintain its control.

155
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:58,480
The gods' names are registered as
supervisor accounts in case of emergency.

156
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:02,680
But the humans outside
never logged in using them.

157
00:12:04,060 --> 00:12:05,140
Wait a sec.

158
00:12:05,380 --> 00:12:08,262
How would you know anything
about the real world?

159
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:10,297
You weren't born here, were you?

160
00:12:10,380 --> 00:12:13,204
You're an outsider, just
like the system admins!

161
00:12:13,820 --> 00:12:14,650
Yes.

162
00:12:14,940 --> 00:12:19,060
And I know you're an outsider
too, Kirito the Unregistered.

163
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:22,320
Yeah, I am.

164
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:25,995
A company called Wrath is
the one that made this world.

165
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:28,300
You know that? Yes, I do.

166
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:30,796
Then you must be the Cardinal System.

167
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:33,257
You're an autonomous program, aren't you?

168
00:12:33,340 --> 00:12:34,640
You run this world.

169
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,597
Ah, so you know about me.

170
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:40,520
than you've interacted with my
kind before in the Outer World.

171
00:12:41,300 --> 00:12:42,300
Oh, yeah.

172
00:12:43,740 --> 00:12:45,500
But you're different.

173
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:50,100
As far as I know, the cardinal system
never had a human-like interface.

174
00:12:50,820 --> 00:12:53,040
So what kind of program are you?

175
00:12:53,340 --> 00:12:54,880
What do you do here?

176
00:12:58,400 --> 00:13:01,000
I'll try to be as succinct as possible.

177
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:03,180
But first, eat.

178
00:13:08,100 --> 00:13:11,697
I've cast a spell on it that will
help your wounds heal faster.

179
00:13:11,780 --> 00:13:14,060
Wow, now that's an admin for you.

180
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:15,860
I am not an administrator.

181
00:13:16,260 --> 00:13:20,319
I can only manipulate the objects
that are contained in this library.

182
00:13:21,780 --> 00:13:25,917
Oh, Cardinal, can you get in touch
with someone in the real world for me?

183
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:26,830
Of course not.

184
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:28,097
If I could do that,

185
00:13:28,180 --> 00:13:32,097
I wouldn't be stuck here in this
dusty place for all these centuries.

186
00:13:32,180 --> 00:13:35,677
Unfortunately, the only one who
has that authority is the Pontifex.

187
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:37,060
Ah, crap.

188
00:13:43,340 --> 00:13:47,500
I told you earlier that no
gods exist in this world.

189
00:13:48,740 --> 00:13:53,328
Technically that's true, but there was
once a time when something similar did.

190
00:13:53,460 --> 00:13:56,060
That was about 450 years ago.

191
00:13:56,580 --> 00:14:01,680
Back when Senator was no more than a
tiny village, there were four gods.

192
00:14:02,340 --> 00:14:03,170
Let me guess.

193
00:14:03,420 --> 00:14:06,797
They were the four staff members
from Wrath who built this place.

194
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:07,821
You are correct.

195
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:11,480
Two males and two females
came to this land.

196
00:14:11,880 --> 00:14:14,939
Each couple raised eight
children each on two farms.

197
00:14:15,220 --> 00:14:20,200
They taught them to read and write, and
how to raise crops, and livestock too,

198
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:25,781
and the moral arguments of good and evil,
which formed the basis of the Taboo Index.

199
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:30,777
Based on how effectively the first four
were able to pass down these teachings,

200
00:14:30,860 --> 00:14:32,980
it's clear that as humans,

201
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:35,221
they were incredibly intelligent.

202
00:14:35,740 --> 00:14:41,680
However, there was one among them who was
not only brilliant, but devious as well.

203
00:14:42,060 --> 00:14:45,620
The children this person raised
inherited selfish desires,

204
00:14:45,900 --> 00:14:48,194
such as the hunger to rule and conquer.

205
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:53,037
The offspring of these children would
eventually become the nobles of this land,

206
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:56,097
as well as the high ministers
of the Axiom Church.

207
00:14:56,180 --> 00:15:02,300
One of them, the current system's supervisor,
is the Pontifex of the Axiom Church,

208
00:15:02,700 --> 00:15:06,020
a woman who controls
everything with an iron fist.

209
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:11,200
She calls herself Administrator,
the most arrogant name imaginable.

210
00:15:12,300 --> 00:15:13,617
That name…

211
00:15:13,700 --> 00:15:16,777
I heard that Eldrie guy
say it. That's right.

212
00:15:16,860 --> 00:15:21,272
He said he was, like, summoned by this
Pontifex Administrator or something.

213
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:24,409
Yes, she's the one I've
been talking about.

214
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:27,300
Sadly, this administrator,

215
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:31,657
while I don't like to admit it, is
my elder twin sister, so to speak.

216
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:32,620
She is?

217
00:15:32,740 --> 00:15:33,681
How do you mean?

218
00:15:33,900 --> 00:15:35,076
I'm getting to that.

219
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:38,564
Several decades after the
first four logged out,

220
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:43,700
the first political marriage was arranged
between two families of the Lord class.

221
00:15:44,060 --> 00:15:46,840
From that union, a baby girl was born.

222
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:52,957
Her name was Queen Nela.

223
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:55,637
Queen Nela, my dear,

224
00:15:55,720 --> 00:16:00,157
henceforth your calling is
to research the sacred arts.

225
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:02,597
Nothing would make me happier, father!

226
00:16:02,680 --> 00:16:03,857
Thank you.

227
00:16:03,940 --> 00:16:07,757
System call.

228
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:10,017
No one else realizes it.

229
00:16:10,100 --> 00:16:12,720
but each sacred word has its own meaning.

230
00:16:13,540 --> 00:16:15,280
Call means to summon.

231
00:16:15,880 --> 00:16:17,409
Generate means to produce.

232
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:22,680
Come on, this way!

233
00:16:32,900 --> 00:16:34,360
System call.

234
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,700
Generate thermal element.

235
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:39,457
Form element. Arrow shape.

236
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:41,840
Fly straight. Discharge.

237
00:16:59,700 --> 00:17:04,980
Lady Queen Ella, please help my
husband walk again. Very well.

238
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:08,940
System Call.

239
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:11,237
Generate Luminous Element.

240
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:12,600
Form Element.

241
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:13,960
Liquid Shape.

242
00:17:20,760 --> 00:17:22,057
It's a miracle.

243
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:25,660
Lady Queenilla, you are
the holy child of Stacia.

244
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:30,260
But her gentle smile was a mask.

245
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:36,480
Quinella had developed a thirst for power,
and now she had the means to seize it.

246
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:44,940
Very soon, we will have a place
where we can worship the gods.

247
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:55,769
In order to control
the growing population,

248
00:17:56,180 --> 00:17:58,317
I must put some laws into place.

249
00:17:58,400 --> 00:18:02,500
to ensure no one else
exceeds my authority level.

250
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:05,320
I will make hunting taboo.

251
00:18:06,180 --> 00:18:08,640
I will outlaw murder as well.

252
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:16,220
Lady Quinella, you wish to see me?

253
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:20,880
This is a holy book containing the
complete words of the goddess Stacia.

254
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:23,037
It is called the Taboo Index.

255
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:28,680
Make copies, distribute it to every town
and village, and have the people obey it.

256
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:30,080
Yes, my lady.

257
00:19:02,220 --> 00:19:04,780
System call.

258
00:19:05,180 --> 00:19:07,037
Open list.

259
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,997
System call.

260
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,540
Read list.

261
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:26,180
System Call...

262
00:19:27,700 --> 00:19:28,530
Inspect...

263
00:19:28,613 --> 00:19:29,500
List...

264
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:34,860
Finally, Quinella opened it.

265
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:37,720
The forbidden door.

266
00:19:40,940 --> 00:19:43,240
It was quite the coincidence.

267
00:19:44,420 --> 00:19:48,280
Although I suspect someone from
the outside world helped her.

268
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:50,517
Let me show you.

269
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:52,160
System call.

270
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:54,820
Inspect entire command list.

271
00:19:56,980 --> 00:19:58,320
You're kidding.

272
00:19:58,820 --> 00:20:04,300
What you see before you is the full catalog
of all the underworld system commands.

273
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:07,297
Quinella's first order of business was to

274
00:20:07,380 --> 00:20:10,100
restore her life and
halt the aging process.

275
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:13,060
Then, she restored her beauty.

276
00:20:15,220 --> 00:20:20,200
In an instant, she regained the
dazzling allure of her late teens.

277
00:20:25,340 --> 00:20:27,928
That should have been
enough to satisfy her.

278
00:20:29,740 --> 00:20:33,600
But no, for Quinella, there
could be no one equal to her.

279
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:38,871
Even the Cardinal System was
something she deemed a threat.

280
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:42,617
So she devised a way to
seize the Cardinal System's

281
00:20:42,700 --> 00:20:46,660
authority level using a sacred
art command she composed.

282
00:20:47,460 --> 00:20:48,820
As a result...

283
00:20:50,600 --> 00:20:53,337
She burned the Prime Directive
of the Cardinal System

284
00:20:53,420 --> 00:20:56,420
into her Fluctlight as her
own behavioral principle.

285
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:59,020
That way, it could not be overwritten.

286
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:01,760
She just wanted its authority level.

287
00:21:02,340 --> 00:21:06,140
Instead, she ended up fusing her
soul with the Cardinal System.

288
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:08,180
To uphold order.

289
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:13,687
That is the Prime Directive of the Cardinal
System and its reason for existing.

290
00:21:13,780 --> 00:21:17,217
As someone who spent time in a
world controlled by the same system,

291
00:21:17,300 --> 00:21:18,594
you should understand.

292
00:21:19,020 --> 00:21:21,961
Cardinal observes the
actions of players like you,

293
00:21:22,140 --> 00:21:25,737
and it corrects anything that
disrupts the balance of the world,

294
00:21:25,820 --> 00:21:27,600
without any mercy.

295
00:21:33,420 --> 00:21:37,460
Queen Ella had fainted and was
unconscious for an entire day.

296
00:21:38,260 --> 00:21:42,880
When she woke up, she had ceased
being human in any sense of the word.

297
00:21:43,520 --> 00:21:46,260
She no longer aged or required sustenance.

298
00:21:47,220 --> 00:21:52,140
Her only desire was to preserve this
realm in its current state forever.

299
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:56,480
I am both ruler and supervisor.

300
00:21:57,220 --> 00:22:00,940
And now, the Pontifex of
the Axiom Church as well.

301
00:22:02,340 --> 00:22:04,580
I am Administrator.

302
00:22:24,040 --> 00:22:25,017
I'll

303
00:23:21,740 --> 00:23:23,858
I'll have to heal a little bit more.

304
00:23:26,940 --> 00:23:28,840
Reality is to you.
